### QuickApiMapper Demo Data - Sample HTTP Requests
### Use this file with Visual Studio HTTP Client, VS Code REST Client, or similar tools

@management_api_base = https://localhost:7001
@web_api_base = http://localhost:5000

### ============================================
### Management API - Check Demo Integrations
### ============================================

### Get all integrations (should include 3 demo integrations)
GET {{management_api_base}}/api/integrations
Accept: application/json

### Get specific demo integration by name
GET {{management_api_base}}/api/integrations?name=Demo:%20JSON%20to%20SOAP%20Order%20Processing
Accept: application/json

### Get integration details by ID (replace with actual ID from previous call)
GET {{management_api_base}}/api/integrations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### Admin Endpoints (Development Only)
### ============================================

### Trigger database migration
POST {{management_api_base}}/api/admin/migrate
Content-Type: application/json

### Manually trigger demo data seeding
POST {{management_api_base}}/api/admin/seed
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================
### QuickApiMapper Web - Test Demo Integration
### ============================================

### Test 1: Standard Order (STANDARD priority -> STD)
POST {{web_api_base}}/api/demo/fulfillment/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-2026-001",
  "customerName": "John Smith",
  "customerEmail": "JOHN.SMITH@EXAMPLE.COM",
  "orderDate": "2026-01-10T14:30:00Z",
  "totalAmount": 599.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "laptop-xps15",
      "productName": "Dell XPS 15 Laptop",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 599.99
    }
  ],
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Seattle",
    "state": "WA",
    "postalCode": "98101",
    "country": "USA"
  },
  "priority": "STANDARD"
}

